{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "there is a chance that you will get a very standard onboarding.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000003"}], "text": "A big brand agency might provide a very standard onboarding, including basic training and eventual placement in a rental department."}, "title": "Working at a Big Brand Agency", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:ea1c2b30878b525e", "metadata_hash": "7147b00e3cb25b389cb5f3b0e5a5207f382974f8608e27e34f43998cd360d1e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Working at a Big Brand Agency", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_in_dubai"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "In any case, by the end of onboarding, you will feel unprepared to close deals.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000004"}], "text": "In a small boutique agency, there is more flexibility, but agents might feel unprepared to close deals after onboarding."}, "title": "Work Dynamics in Boutique Agencies", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:cb7f09926ba1d4af", "metadata_hash": "7147b00e3cb25b389cb5f3b0e5a5207f382974f8608e27e34f43998cd360d1e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Work Dynamics in Boutique Agencies", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_in_dubai"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000006"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "the company, not only the company in Dubai, is the sponsor for your residency visa.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000005"}, {"quote": "It doesn't mean that you will not be able to make it, but you should have at least three months tourist visa to survive that period.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000006"}], "text": "The residency visa process in Dubai often begins after the first deal is closed, which can leave agents vulnerable."}, "title": "Employment and Visa Process", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:3d68434d64686ff0", "metadata_hash": "7147b00e3cb25b389cb5f3b0e5a5207f382974f8608e27e34f43998cd360d1e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Employment and Visa Process", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_in_dubai"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000010", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000011"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "So the only real way for you to generate leads is good old cold calling.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000011"}], "text": "The primary method for generating leads in the secondary real estate market in Dubai is cold calling."}, "title": "Cold Calling as a Necessity", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:bf134b4083d5268a", "metadata_hash": "7147b00e3cb25b389cb5f3b0e5a5207f382974f8608e27e34f43998cd360d1e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Cold Calling as a Necessity", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_in_dubai"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000012", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000013"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "In many cases, hundreds of other agencies are advertising the same project and get the same leads.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000013"}], "text": "Off-plan real estate in Dubai has a competitive environment with many agencies advertising the same projects."}, "title": "Off-plan Real Estate Dynamics", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:8425c08d2fab080e", "metadata_hash": "7147b00e3cb25b389cb5f3b0e5a5207f382974f8608e27e34f43998cd360d1e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Off-plan Real Estate Dynamics", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_in_dubai"}
