{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000008"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": {"citations": [{"quote": "she opened a court case and won.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000008"}], "text": "Ekaterina opened a court case after the company decided to keep $600,000 of her commission and won the case."}, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "I want to bring up my coaching client example, Ekaterina, who was my top selling agent in 2025.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000008"}], "text": "Ekaterina, a client, was a top-selling agent in 2025 with a commission of $1,650,000."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Client Success Story: Ekaterina", "topic": "real_estate_success"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:cases:ec65666bd8777215", "metadata_hash": "7147b00e3cb25b389cb5f3b0e5a5207f382974f8608e27e34f43998cd360d1e6", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Client Success Story: Ekaterina", "topic": "real_estate_success", "topic_slug": "real_estate_success"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000021", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000022"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": {"citations": [{"quote": "in three weeks, middle of April, he closed his first off-plan deal. Five thousand five hundred dollars is already in his pocket.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000021"}], "text": "Georges closed his first off-plan deal in three weeks, earning $5,500."}, "rationale": {"citations": [{"quote": "I know I can make it. I see this as an opportunity.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000021"}], "text": "Georges saw it as an opportunity despite the language barrier and current conflict."}, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "The story of Georges or Geo as we call him, as you saw my YouTube videos, joined my academy.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000021"}], "text": "Georges, a Greek client, joined Olgasi's academy despite a challenging opportunity and language barrier."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Client Success Story: Georges", "topic": "real_estate_success"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:cases:71bc3a0471c93f8b", "metadata_hash": "7147b00e3cb25b389cb5f3b0e5a5207f382974f8608e27e34f43998cd360d1e6", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Client Success Story: Georges", "topic": "real_estate_success", "topic_slug": "real_estate_success"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000001"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Most of them quit within six months. Not because they are lazy, but because nobody explains what the industry looks like after you land.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000001"}], "text": "The speaker outlines the challenge of entering the Dubai real estate market, emphasizing the high dropout rate within six months and contrasts this with the appealing prospect of making high commissions to frame the difficulty and allure of the career."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Framing the Industry Challenge", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:expression:5f197933102decce", "metadata_hash": "7147b00e3cb25b389cb5f3b0e5a5207f382974f8608e27e34f43998cd360d1e6", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Framing the Industry Challenge", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_in_dubai"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000003", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000004"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "If you will go with a big brand, like 100 plus agent, there is a chance that you will get a very standard onboarding.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000003"}, {"quote": "Well, a small boutique agency will give you probably what I call train as you go on board.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000004"}], "text": "The speaker compares working at a big brand agency versus a small boutique agency, discussing onboarding processes and their outcomes to demonstrate different agency environments."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Comparison of Agency Types", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:expression:d19e7dc11010091c", "metadata_hash": "7147b00e3cb25b389cb5f3b0e5a5207f382974f8608e27e34f43998cd360d1e6", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Comparison of Agency Types", "topic": "real_estate_in_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_in_dubai"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000008"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Ekaterina, who was my top selling agent in 2025. She closed 1,650,000 in her own commission, but the company decided that they want to keep 600,000 out of it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000008"}], "text": "The speaker uses a detailed client success story involving a legal battle and commission recovery to establish credibility and highlight the importance of being well-documented."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Client Example to Build Credibility", "topic": "real_estate_success"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:expression:8cdba22c19fd2c02", "metadata_hash": "7147b00e3cb25b389cb5f3b0e5a5207f382974f8608e27e34f43998cd360d1e6", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Client Example to Build Credibility", "topic": "real_estate_success", "topic_slug": "real_estate_success"}
